 (let ((@x36 (monotonicity (rewrite (= x (fp ((_ extract 7 7) k!00) ?x29 ?x30))) (= (fp.abs x) (fp.abs (fp ((_ extract 7 7) k!00) ?x29 ?x30))))))
 (let ((@x41 (trans @x36 (rewrite (= (fp.abs (fp ((_ extract 7 7) k!00) ?x29 ?x30)) ?x37)) (= (fp.abs x) ?x37))))
 (let ((@x56 (trans (monotonicity @x41 (= (fp.isNegative (fp.abs x)) $x42)) (rewrite (= $x42 $x52)) (= (fp.isNegative (fp.abs x)) $x52))))
